title Subsequence - Hash password and create user

control AuthService
boundary HashUtils
control UserService
entity UserModel
database MongoDB

AuthService -> HashUtils: 1. Hash password
activate AuthService
activate HashUtils
HashUtils --> AuthService: 2. Hashed password
deactivate HashUtils

AuthService -> UserService: 3. Create new user

activate UserService
UserService -> UserModel: 4. insert user
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 5. Insert user data
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 6. New user data
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 7. New user created
deactivate UserModel

UserService --> AuthService: 8. User entity
deactivate UserService
deactivate AuthService
